=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI-Driven Protagonist &amp; True Companion:</strong><br>Adam is brought to life with an advanced AI system, making him feel and act like a real companion throughout your journey. He reacts to situations, shares his thoughts, engages you directly as the player, and sometimes even breaks the fourth wall. Every conversation, reaction, and decision adds depth to the adventure\u2014and you can customize how much Adam interacts with you, tailoring the experience to your preference.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Story &amp; Atmosphere:</strong><br>Unravel a unique, unpredictable narrative filled with psychological horror and mystery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning Visuals:</strong><br>Explore atmospheric environments with high-quality graphics and immersive effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse &amp; Challenging Levels:</strong><br>Encounter new hazards, puzzles, and enemies in every area for a consistently fresh experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blending Real and Virtual Worlds:</strong><br>The game creatively mixes real-world interaction with the virtual environment, requiring you to think beyond the screen to solve certain puzzles and challenges. Some enigmas can only be solved by combining clues from both realities, offering a truly unique gameplay twist.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Not an Imitation:</strong><br>Enjoy innovative ideas and mechanics\u2014ENTITY: THE BLACK DAY is not another clone.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2517220/extras/e50ac3ec23ef403140159984aa66bea3.poster.avif?t=1760933639\" width=738 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2517220/extras/e50ac3ec23ef403140159984aa66bea3.webm?t=1760933639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Important Note</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is an Early Access version. By purchasing now, you will:</strong><br>\u2714 Enjoy an early experience.<br>\u2714 Save money by receiving the full release for free upon launch.<br>\u2714 Support ongoing development efforts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Supported Languages \ud83c\udf0d:</strong><br>English, \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0631\u0628\u064a\u0629, \u0420\u0443\u0441\u0441\u043a\u0438\u0439, \u4e2d\u6587\uff08\u7b80\u4f53\uff09, \u65e5\u672c\u8a9e, Deutsch, Espa\u00f1ol (Espa\u00f1a), \ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4, Portugu\u00eas (Brasil), Polski, Fran\u00e7ais, Italiano, Espa\u00f1ol (Latinoam\u00e9rica), \u4e2d\u6587\uff08\u7e41\u9ad4\uff09, Nederlands, Bahasa Melayu, \u010ce\u0161tina, Dansk, Suomi, Magyar, Norsk, Portugu\u00eas (Portugal), Rom\u00e2n\u0103, Svenska, T\u00fcrk\u00e7e</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2517220/extras/aaf7601a0a9a10709f80a4934c857199.poster.avif?t=1760933639\" width=780 height=379 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2517220/extras/aaf7601a0a9a10709f80a4934c857199.webm?t=1760933639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","developers":["ALI AL-ABBOODI"],"drm_notice":"Denuvo Anti-Tampering","genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2517220/b10342e4b3fb17515aa1bd754749c5a918f405b5/header.jpg?